(7594374, 1225293, 87808, '<td valign="top">As soon as I saw this, I wanted to give this a 10.  It tell''s a story, everyone knows what it is about.  It is a crisp, clean shot with drama. I can see this on a cover of a Mickey Spillane (my childhood hero btw).  But then I looked again, and I wish it had a little softness to it, a mystic, and almost old time feel to it, a light colouring to it, so it did look like a book cover or something MS''s from the 40''s.  It is too crisp and clean. Adding a softness and vinaigrette and maybe a touch of grain.  This is how I would see this picture and  give it a 10++++++. 9 from me as it is a drool worthy picture for myself. Can not wait to see who this was shot by as I think, you did another shot in Smoke that I love.</td>', 'As soon as I saw this, I wanted to give this a 10.  It tell''s a story, everyone knows what it is about.  It is a crisp, clean shot with drama. I can see this on a cover of a Mickey Spillane (my childhood hero btw).  But then I looked again, and I wish it had a little softness to it, a mystic, and almost old time feel to it, a light colouring to it, so it did look like a book cover or something MS''s from the 40''s.  It is too crisp and clean. Adding a softness and vinaigrette and maybe a touch of grain.  This is how I would see this picture and  give it a 10++++++. 9 from me as it is a drool worthy picture for myself. Can not wait to see who this was shot by as I think, you did another shot in Smoke that I love.', '2018-08-29 17:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
