(7594610, 1225032, 31829, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, however, seems overprocessed and/or selectively sharpened/blurred. When it''s obvious I lose interest. If the eyeball was that tach sharp even with a shallow aperture, so would the eyebrow so it is obvious you post processed this to the point it doesn''t look real.<br/> <br/>Great pose though. Would love to see the original</td>', 'Nice portrait, however, seems overprocessed and/or selectively sharpened/blurred. When it''s obvious I lose interest. If the eyeball was that tach sharp even with a shallow aperture, so would the eyebrow so it is obvious you post processed this to the point it doesn''t look real. Great pose though. Would love to see the original', '2018-09-01 00:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
