(7594981, 1225052, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m having such mixed feelings about this. I really think a portrait should show the person, and the face being hidden is really throwing me. I love the processing and the shot, but it doesn''t say portrait to me, because I don''t feel I''m learning anything about the person. I don''t know if they''re happy, sad, it they''re liking their their predicament or hating it. I always thought a portrait was more personal. Gack. Don''t know what to do with this one.</td>', 'I''m having such mixed feelings about this. I really think a portrait should show the person, and the face being hidden is really throwing me. I love the processing and the shot, but it doesn''t say portrait to me, because I don''t feel I''m learning anything about the person. I don''t know if they''re happy, sad, it they''re liking their their predicament or hating it. I always thought a portrait was more personal. Gack. Don''t know what to do with this one.', '2018-09-04 21:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
