(7595065, 1225084, 40391, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> This one is confusing me. With the amount of light in the background and what looks like two catch lights in the eyes, it seems like there''s more than one light source on this. Or is it just edited well to control the lighting? I''d love to see the original and see what/how/...? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I almost didnt enter this because of the various light sources present. However, the primary light was from my headlights. This is also why you see two catch lights in his eye. Without the headlights he would mostly be a silhouette.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: This one is confusing me. With the amount of light in the background and what looks like two catch lights in the eyes, it seems like there''s more than one light source on this. Or is it just edited well to control the lighting? I''d love to see the original and see what/how/...?   I almost didnt enter this because of the various light sources present. However, the primary light was from my headlights. This is also why you see two catch lights in his eye. Without the headlights he would mostly be a silhouette.', '2018-09-05 02:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
