(7595269, 1225032, 87808, '<td valign="top">I can certainly see where <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=31829" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LanceW</a> is coming from. But in all honesty, until he mentioned it, I didn''t really notice it too much. For me, it is not about how sharp it is but (now it is pointed out) I can see the white in the iris as a little bright. So makes it look super sharp, I did originally give it a 10, then came back and gave it a 9 and the only reason, was not in fact the eyes, but the chin area near the lower lips, it wasn''t as sharp as the top lip line. But I tell you what, anyone would be darn proud to have that stunning portrait on proud display. Wish I had known you when my kid where babies!!</td>', 'I can certainly see where  LanceW is coming from. But in all honesty, until he mentioned it, I didn''t really notice it too much. For me, it is not about how sharp it is but (now it is pointed out) I can see the white in the iris as a little bright. So makes it look super sharp, I did originally give it a 10, then came back and gave it a 9 and the only reason, was not in fact the eyes, but the chin area near the lower lips, it wasn''t as sharp as the top lip line. But I tell you what, anyone would be darn proud to have that stunning portrait on proud display. Wish I had known you when my kid where babies!!', '2018-09-06 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7595270, 1225306, 87808, '<td valign="top">Well, wow, I am a tad shocked, I thought this was fantastic. You have all this light, fantastic model and even stars in the night sky! I am guessing it may be because this is not a head portrait.  I would be super proud if I had managed something like this.  Well done.</td>', 'Well, wow, I am a tad shocked, I thought this was fantastic. You have all this light, fantastic model and even stars in the night sky! I am guessing it may be because this is not a head portrait.  I would be super proud if I had managed something like this.  Well done.', '2018-09-06 14:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7595272, 1225378, 87808, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. I thought it was a very powerful shot, with a story behind it.  Probably got so dinged as it was not a full portrait of a head. But this is so emotive, I can honestly see this hanging in a gallery. I am sorry, I did not know your father was poorly, What a struggle for him and yourself. I think that the score affects you more, as you are pouring your heart into the photo as much as into real life.  If you can, please do not stop taking photos of your Dad or life.  Try to ignore the low votes and just be so proud of what you are communicating in your photos to some people. That is what counts in the end, that you did touch people, who have no idea about what is going on.  All my love to you both.<br/> <br/>Edited to add.  On the my vote scale, you came in 5th place in the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-09-06 13:26:23.</i></td>', 'I gave this a 9. I thought it was a very powerful shot, with a story behind it.  Probably got so dinged as it was not a full portrait of a head. But this is so emotive, I can honestly see this hanging in a gallery. I am sorry, I did not know your father was poorly, What a struggle for him and yourself. I think that the score affects you more, as you are pouring your heart into the photo as much as into real life.  If you can, please do not stop taking photos of your Dad or life.  Try to ignore the low votes and just be so proud of what you are communicating in your photos to some people. That is what counts in the end, that you did touch people, who have no idea about what is going on.  All my love to you both. Edited to add.  On the my vote scale, you came in 5th place in the challenge.', '2018-09-06 14:25:29.000000', '2018-09-06 14:26:23.000000', 0),
(7595794, 1225402, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by texdon:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> .... same girl all grown up </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, and she listens better now, too! It was a battle getting her to look through that hole. :-)<br/> <br/>And it is a single light source. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> Excellent on both counts then :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by texdon: Originally posted by Neat: .... same girl all grown up   Yep, and she listens better now, too! It was a battle getting her to look through that hole. :-) And it is a single light source.    Excellent on both counts then :-)', '2018-09-10 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
